    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99aa535c4f2ee8647821b181",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竟然，收到了来自美国的邀请……！\n也就是说您要成为彼国的『女王』，\n所以才准备前往那里吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ed6c6d4ed279f97cf9c4aadd12675fcb218e4ace0af2937d0cbc1e926b8756",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111312.json",
      "json_path": [
